WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.790
Automations: keywords in DMs, comments and stories that start a reply: a fixed reply, a ready flow, or an AI conversation with a mission.

2
00:00:12.341 --> 00:00:22.680
Pick DM, comment or story automation, write the keywords, and choose the reply. For comments, you can set a public reply and a private DM together.

3
00:00:23.229 --> 00:00:30.460
Use Test a message with a sample sentence to see which automation replies. Small typos are understood too.

4
00:00:31.008 --> 00:00:41.610
The switch on each card turns it on or pauses it, and its stats are on the card. A very general word catches every message, so use precise words.
